  kingdomName: The Aradas
  kingdomStory: 'The Aradas are the people of omniscience. They are origins of humanity
    so they identify themselves with all that is out there which makes them unidentifiable.
    They are everyone and no one at the same time. They surf through identities because
    they know identities are abstractions of the human mind. '
